    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d277">

                <pb facs="0500" n="214" sameAs="frus:frus1916Supp/pg214"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 841.857P43/45</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Philip</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-03-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 8, 1916, noon</hi>
                        </date>.<lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received March 26, 9 a.
                        m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1640. Your 1786,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d277-f1"/> February 2, 3 p. m. <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Note verbale</hi> from the Sublime Porte dated March 7
                    states that the <hi rendition="#italic">Persia</hi> was not sunk by a submarine
                    flying the flag of Turkey. The note adds that, <pb facs="0501" n="215"
                        xml:id="pg215"/> Inasmuch as all naval vessels acting under the instructions
                    of the Turkish Government must necessarily fly Ottoman flag, it could not
                    therefore have been an Ottoman submarine or one acting under the instructions of
                    the Turkish Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Philip</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
